## Get Global Statistics [GET /stat/global{?allowDuplicates}]

Returns aggregated statistics across all players for the selected game mode. If no statistics are available for the requested mode, the endpoint returns `503`.

+ Parameters
    + allowDuplicates: `false` (boolean, required) - Whether to retrieve statistics for games that allowed duplicate colors.

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (object)
        + longestDuration: 120000 (number, required) - Longest recorded game duration in milliseconds.
        + shortestDuration: 15000 (number, required) - Shortest recorded game duration in milliseconds.
        + averageDuration: 45000 (number, required) - Average game duration in milliseconds.
        + mostGuesses: 12 (number, required) - Highest number of guesses used to complete a game.
        + fewestGuesses: 3 (number, required) - Lowest number of guesses used to complete a game.
        + averageGuesses: 6.8 (number, required) - Average number of guesses.
        + count: 13.2 (number, required) - Global average games per player.

+ Response 400 (text/plain)

        Invalid data

+ Response 503 (text/plain)

        No statistics available